11. Conclusion
HashMap, TreeMap and LinkedHashMap have different advantages depending on the requirements of the pharmacy inventory system.
- HashMap is suitable for fast medicine stock lookups.
- TreeMap is suitable for automatically generating medicine reports in code order.
- LinkedHashMap is suitable for maintaining medicines in insertion order.
For the hospital pharmacy, I would recommend HashMap for frequent stock lookups, with sorting for the code-order report and a separate insertion-order list for the second report.

This provides fast average lookup while satisfying both reporting requirements.
